			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 708090301,
					"content": "（鳥巢內有許多零散的碎紙條，似乎還有七零八落的字跡…）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						708090302
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 708090302,
					"content": "這些紙條…不會是牠們為了築巢特意撕開的吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						708090303
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 708090303,
					"content": "上面好像還有字，要不要拼起來看看寫了什麼？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						708090304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 708090304,
					"content": "搞半天還是要自己拼…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						708090305
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 708090305,
					"content": "#{F#妳}{M#你}就不好奇嗎？說不定是什麼藏寶圖耶！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						708090306
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 708090306,
					"content": "在派蒙的連聲催促下拼好了紙條…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						708090307
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 708090307,
					"content": "讓我看看…這是…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						708090308
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 708090308,
					"content": "這…這難道是…「犯罪計畫書」嗎？！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						708090309,
						708090311
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 708090309,
					"content": "誰的犯罪計畫會被鳥叼走啊！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						708090310
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 708090310,
					"content": "但…但是小說裡常常有這種情節吧？！萬無一失的計畫，偏偏就在最不可能的地方出了疏漏…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						708090313
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 708090313,
					"content": "我們去附近的酒館裡打聽一下吧？看看有沒有誰聽說過「最近有人要犯罪了！」什麼的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 708090311,
					"content": "寧可信其有，不可信其無…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						708090312
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 708090312,
					"content": "#{F#妳}{M#你}…{F#妳}{M#你}說得對，不怕一萬，就怕萬一…如果真的有人打算犯罪，之後再後悔就太晚了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						708090313
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
		},
